pace 2

## SQ-WCD-04 | wildCrops = false: nothing applied, Farmer's wild cabbages back on beaches (beach away from spawn)
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[wild-crops\] off in creativedelight-common.toml \[worldgen\] wildCrops
bootreject \[wild-crops\] \d+ crop modifiers added
shell grep -n "wildCrops" config/creativedelight-common.toml
> execute positioned -2500 70 -2500 run locate biome minecraft:beach
waitlog The nearest minecraft:beach 600
capture BC The nearest minecraft:beach is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {BC1-48} {BC3-48} {BC1+48} {BC3+48}
sleep 40
> zq count {BC1-56} 50 {BC3-56} {BC1+56} 100 {BC3+56} minecraft:sand
waitlog \[zq\] count minecraft:sand 300
> zq count {BC1-56} 50 {BC3-56} {BC1+56} 100 {BC3+56} farmersdelight:wild_cabbages
waitlog \[zq\] count farmersdelight:wild_cabbages 300
expect \[zq\] count farmersdelight:wild_cabbages: [1-9]
look the beach (near -2500 -2500) is new ground (not within 400 blocks of r_B.qb's forceloads); the sand count says how much beach the box holds; 0 cabbages on thousands of sand blocks is a fail
